# This app needs NO API keys or secrets to run.
#
# IBAN validation uses openIBAN (free, keyless), so there is nothing to
# configure for the BIC/bank auto-fill to work — locally or in production.
#
# Optional overrides (rarely needed):
# TEMPLATE_PATH=./RAPPORT MYFIN xx.docx        # path to the .docx template
# OPENIBAN_URL=https://openiban.com/validate   # IBAN lookup endpoint
